Section 471 IPC: Using as genuine a forged document: Whoever fraudulently or dishonestly uses as genuine any document which he knows or has reason to believe to be a forged document, shall be punished in the same manner as if he had forged such document. Section 468 IPC: Forgery for purpose of cheating: Whoever commitsforgery, intending that the document or electronic record1forged shall be used for the purpose ofcheating, shall be punished with imprisonment of either description for a term which may extend to seven years, and shall also be liable to fine.
